sequenceDiagram
    participant W as ERP outbox worker
    participant A as WMS acceptance API
    participant D as WMS database
    W->>A: Submit authenticated source, stable ID, payload
    A->>D: Begin transaction; insert receipt and accepted order
    D-->>A: Commit both records
    A--xW: Acceptance response lost
    Note over W: Timeout means outcome unknown, not rejection
    W->>W: Persist retry schedule and attempt history
    W->>A: Resend same identity and content
    A->>D: Find existing receipt; compare canonical content
    D-->>A: Original accepted outcome
    A-->>W: Return original outcome without second order
    W->>W: Mark delivery acknowledged
